    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trade Republic","url":"https://de.linkedin.com/company/trade-republic"},"datePublished":"2026-10-07T12:59:39.591Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":40},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_traderepublic-activity-7513583825319452672--yTS","text":"Top 5 crypto staking.\n\nFor blockchains like Ethereum or Solana, transactions are verified through staking.\n\nWith locking up cryptos to help support the network, you can earn regular rewards.\n\nWe looked at the coins our users stake the most.\n\nDo you stake your cryptos?\n\n#traderepublic\n\nTransactions in crypto assets carry significant risks. The performance can be highly volatile and past performance is not a reliable indicator of future results. A total loss of the invested money is possible. While staking, your coins cannot be sold. Securities shown are for illustrative purposes only and do not constitute investment advice.\n\nSource: Trade Republic data. Customers holding a net-positive staked position.\n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_traderepublic-activity-7513583825319452672--yTS"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trade Republic","url":"https://de.linkedin.com/company/trade-republic"},"datePublished":"2026-10-01T08:00:35.931Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":335},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_traderepublic-activity-7511334236960743426-wpGV","text":"We are launching banking in Greece.\n\n58 % of Greek household financial assets are held in deposits, at an average interest rate of 0.03 % p.a.\n\nThat changes today.\n\n-- A free current account to receive your salary, pay bills, and make instant SEPA transfers\u2028\n-- Interest on all your cash\u2028\n-- 1 % Saveback on eligible card payments invested directly into your savings plan\n\nThis complements our existing investing offering of stocks, ETFs and bonds.\n\nEveryday spending and long-term wealth in one app.\n\n#traderepublic\n\nInvesting involves risk. Receive interest from partner banks and dividends from liquidity funds (subject to market risk). Saveback T&Cs apply. Any transactions shown are for illustrative purposes only.\n\nSource: Bank of Greece","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_traderepublic-activity-7511334236960743426-wpGV"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trade Republic","url":"https://de.linkedin.com/company/trade-republic"},"datePublished":"2026-09-30T14:20:39.385Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":175},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_traderepublic-finance26-activity-7511067493709303809-qMkb","text":"Trade Republic x Finance26.\n\n2 days, 1 stage, 11,500 visitors.\n\nIn July, we launched our Web Terminal. \nAt the fair, we showed it to all visitors in person. \n\n-- Live demos and market analysis.\u2028\n-- Quiz sessions between presentations.\u2028\n-- Merch giveaways for the community.\n\nAt the booth, we connected directly with our users: answered questions, gathered feedback. \n\nThanks to everyone who stopped by.\n\n#traderepublic #finance26\n\nInvesting involves risks. Not investment advice. Transactions in crypto assets carry significant risks. The performance can be highly volatile and past performance is no reliable indicator for future performance. A total loss of the invested money is possible.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_traderepublic-finance26-activity-7511067493709303809-qMkb"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trade Republic","url":"https://de.linkedin.com/company/trade-republic"},"datePublished":"2026-09-29T11:55:58.174Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":67},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_top-5-sectors-activity-7510668694210105344-lx4F","text":"Top 5 sectors by share of portfolio value.\n\nSoftware takes the #1 spot across markets. \nSemiconductors and financials are following in most countries. \n\nBeyond the top 3, there are some local market preferences.\n\u2028-- French investors favor Oil & Gas\u2028\n-- Belgian portfolios feature Real Estate\u2028\n-- Italian portfolios lean into Automotive\n\nWhat sectors dominate your portfolio?\n\n#traderepublic\n\nInvesting involves risks. Past performance is not a reliable indicator of future results.\n\nSource: Trade Republic data. Top 5 sectors by portfolio value, by country.\n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_top-5-sectors-activity-7510668694210105344-lx4F"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trade Republic","url":"https://de.linkedin.com/company/trade-republic"},"datePublished":"2026-09-26T09:36:23.085Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":180},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_traderepublic-sheleads-activity-7509546402939801600-VUlQ","text":"Trade Republic x SheLeads. Round 2.\n\nThe first session was all about building wealth. This one focused on the career that funds it.\nFor that, early-career women joined us in Berlin last week.\n\nOur Product Owner Aleksandra S., Compliance Manager Juliane Kisse and Corporate Development Associate Franziska Brandmann took a deep dive into:\n\n-- What ownership looks like when teams move fast.\n-- How to build visibility while navigating a high-growth company.\u2028\n-- Where different functions cross paths and collaborate.\n\nFollowed by an open Q&A over drinks and food.\n\nThanks to SheLeads and everyone who came.\n\n#traderepublic #sheleads","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_traderepublic-sheleads-activity-7509546402939801600-VUlQ"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trade Republic","url":"https://de.linkedin.com/company/trade-republic"},"datePublished":"2026-09-22T17:02:57.161Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":621},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_traderepublic-activity-7508209233977606144-0RL2","text":"Building wealth should not stop at your personal account.\n\nThat’s why we launched the Trade Republic Private Holding account. Available for single-owned GmbHs and UGs focused on investing and trading.\n\n-- Earn 2.5 % on all uninvested cash.\u2028\n-- Invest from 1 € in stocks, ETFs and other assets.\u2028\n-- Pay as little as ~1.5% tax on capital gains from stocks.\n\nPut your GmbH or UG’s money to work.\n\n#traderepublic\n\nInvestment involves risks. Cash balances held in liquidity funds, which are subject to market risk. Trade Republic does not provide tax advice. Private Holding account is currently available for UG (haftungsbeschränkt) and GmbH with sole ownership. Past performance does not guarantee future results. Any securities or transactions shown are for illustrative purposes only. Crypto is highly volatile, total capital loss is possible.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_traderepublic-activity-7508209233977606144-0RL2"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trade Republic","url":"https://de.linkedin.com/company/trade-republic"},"datePublished":"2026-09-18T07:57:08.209Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":169},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_traderepublic-activity-7506622323458973696-ICgp","text":"Trader Event.\n\nLast week we invited users to our Berlin office.\n\nTogether with Oswald Salcher and Michael Flender, we walked them through our Web Terminal.\n\n-- How users can customize the terminal.\n-- How users can trade via Best Price or Direct Price to select across 30 global exchanges.\n-- How to leverage advanced charting, tools, and real-time data.\n\nWe listened to their feedback. More to come.\n\n#traderepublic\n﻿\nOrders will be executed at the Best Price across all relevant exchanges against Trade Republic. For 1 € (plus ETF costs & spreads). Investing involve risks. Past performance is not a reliable indicator of future results.\n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_traderepublic-activity-7506622323458973696-ICgp"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trade Republic","url":"https://de.linkedin.com/company/trade-republic"},"datePublished":"2026-09-16T09:43:34.536Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":217},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_banking-launch-finland-activity-7505924333920509952-M65-","text":"We are launching banking in Finland.\n\n60 % of Finnish household deposits sit in overnight accounts earning an average of just 0.37 % p.a.\n\nThat changes today, as we launch our full banking experience in Finland.\n\n-- A free current account to receive salaries, pay bills, and make instant SEPA transfers\n-- Interest on all your cash\n-- 1 % Saveback on eligible card payments invested directly into your savings plan\n\nTime for a new generation of Finnish savers to put their money to work.\n\n#TradeRepublic\n\nInvesting involves risk. Receive interest from partner banks and dividends from liquidity funds (subject to market risk). Saveback T&Cs apply.\nSource: Bank of Finland, August 2026. Any securities or transactions shown are for illustrative purposes only and do not constitute investment advice.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_banking-launch-finland-activity-7505924333920509952-M65-"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trade Republic","url":"https://de.linkedin.com/company/trade-republic"},"datePublished":"2026-09-15T09:00:49.932Z","headline":"","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":311},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_traderepublic-activity-7505551189648920576-W0p0","text":"90 billion euros sit in Belgian current accounts, earning close to no interest.\n\nWe’re putting an end to that with the official launch of our fully localised offer in Belgium:\n\n-- A free current account with a local IBAN\n-- Interest on all your cash\n-- Automated tax management with local tax reporting \n\nIt is time to expect more from your bank. Join our over 100.000 Belgium customers.\n\nAccess to new features will be rolled out to all customers in the coming days.\n\n#TradeRepublic\n\nInvesting involves risks. Products offered by Trade Republic Bank GmbH, Belgium branch. Trade Republic does not provide tax advice.\nSource: Financial accounts of Belgium, National Bank of Belgium, July 2026\n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_traderepublic-activity-7505551189648920576-W0p0"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trade Republic","url":"https://de.linkedin.com/company/trade-republic"},"datePublished":"2026-09-12T10:45:03.425Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":93},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_european-tax-wrappers-activity-7504490255048417280-TdBn","text":"Tax wrappers are a great way to help people start investing.\n\nSeveral European countries have already launched tax wrappers to make investing easier. From France's PEA to Poland's IKE.\n\nMost European countries still do not have one, and progress is slow.\n\nMeanwhile, the pension gap keeps growing. Young Europeans are paying into a system built on promises their generation may never fully see.\n\nTax wrappers will not close that gap themselves. But they are one of the clearest tools Europe has to get more people building wealth directly in the capital markets.\n\nWe think every European should have access to one.\n\nDo you agree?\n\n#TradeRepublic\n\nInvesting involves risks. Past performance is not a reliable indicator of future results. ","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trade-republic_european-tax-wrappers-activity-7504490255048417280-TdBn"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Trade Republic","url":"https://de.linkedin.com/company/trade-republic","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Berlin","addressRegion":"Berlin","postalCode":"10435","addressCountry":"DE"},"description":"What does your Bank offer? ","numberOfEmployees":{"value":1758,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQF9K-KSuAqnVw/company-logo_200_200/B4EZrAuAs1KkAI-/0/1764169878759/trade_republic_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=PXmvj5jWKKaOVQVcNX-1rsIexiYnBqLkjrbqPmICWx8","description":"Trade Republic","@type":"ImageObject"},"slogan":"What does your bank offer?","sameAs":"traderepublic.com"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
