    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Top 5 crypto staking.

For blockchains like Ethereum or Solana, transactions are verified through staking.

With locking up cryptos to help support the network, you can earn regular rewards.

We looked at the coins our users stake the most.

Do you stake your cryptos?

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftraderepublic&amp;_l=de&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#traderepublic</a>

Transactions in crypto assets carry significant risks. The performance can be highly volatile and past performance is not a reliable indicator of future results. A total loss of the invested money is possible. While staking, your coins cannot be sold. Securities shown are for illustrative purposes only and do not constitute investment advice.

Source: Trade Republic data. Customers holding a net-positive staked position.
</p>
