  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">We are launching banking in Greece.

58 % of Greek household financial assets are held in deposits, at an average interest rate of 0.03 % p.a.

That changes today.

-- A free current account to receive your salary, pay bills, and make instant SEPA transfers 
-- Interest on all your cash 
-- 1 % Saveback on eligible card payments invested directly into your savings plan

This complements our existing investing offering of stocks, ETFs and bonds.

Everyday spending and long-term wealth in one app.

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftraderepublic&amp;_l=de&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#traderepublic</a>

Investing involves risk. Receive interest from partner banks and dividends from liquidity funds (subject to market risk). Saveback T&amp;Cs apply. Any transactions shown are for illustrative purposes only.

Source: Bank of Greece</p>
