    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Trade Republic x Finance26.

2 days, 1 stage, 11,500 visitors.

In July, we launched our Web Terminal. 
At the fair, we showed it to all visitors in person. 

-- Live demos and market analysis. 
-- Quiz sessions between presentations. 
-- Merch giveaways for the community.

At the booth, we connected directly with our users: answered questions, gathered feedback. 

Thanks to everyone who stopped by.

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftraderepublic&amp;_l=de&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#traderepublic</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ffinance26&amp;_l=de&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#finance26</a>

Investing involves risks. Not investment advice. Transactions in crypto assets carry significant risks. The performance can be highly volatile and past performance is no reliable indicator for future performance. A total loss of the invested money is possible.</p>
