  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Building wealth should not stop at your personal account.

That’s why we launched the Trade Republic Private Holding account. Available for single-owned GmbHs and UGs focused on investing and trading.

-- Earn 2.5 % on all uninvested cash. 
-- Invest from 1 € in stocks, ETFs and other assets. 
-- Pay as little as ~1.5% tax on capital gains from stocks.

Put your GmbH or UG’s money to work.

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftraderepublic&amp;_l=de&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#traderepublic</a>

Investment involves risks. Cash balances held in liquidity funds, which are subject to market risk. Trade Republic does not provide tax advice. Private Holding account is currently available for UG (haftungsbeschränkt) and GmbH with sole ownership. Past performance does not guarantee future results. Any securities or transactions shown are for illustrative purposes only. Crypto is highly volatile, total capital loss is possible.</p>
