  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Trader Event.

Last week we invited users to our Berlin office.

Together with <a class="link" href="https://at.linkedin.com/in/oswald-salcher-382a8582?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Oswald Salcher</a> and <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/goldeselinvesting?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Michael Flender</a>, we walked them through our Web Terminal.

-- How users can customize the terminal.
-- How users can trade via Best Price or Direct Price to select across 30 global exchanges.
-- How to leverage advanced charting, tools, and real-time data.

We listened to their feedback. More to come.

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftraderepublic&amp;_l=de&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#traderepublic</a>

Orders will be executed at the Best Price across all relevant exchanges against Trade Republic. For 1 € (plus ETF costs &amp; spreads). Investing involve risks. Past performance is not a reliable indicator of future results.
</p>
