  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">We are launching banking in Finland.

60 % of Finnish household deposits sit in overnight accounts earning an average of just 0.37 % p.a.

That changes today, as we launch our full banking experience in Finland.

-- A free current account to receive salaries, pay bills, and make instant SEPA transfers
-- Interest on all your cash
-- 1 % Saveback on eligible card payments invested directly into your savings plan

Time for a new generation of Finnish savers to put their money to work.

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftraderepublic&amp;_l=de&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TradeRepublic</a>

Investing involves risk. Receive interest from partner banks and dividends from liquidity funds (subject to market risk). Saveback T&amp;Cs apply.
Source: Bank of Finland, August 2026. Any securities or transactions shown are for illustrative purposes only and do not constitute investment advice.</p>
