  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">90 billion euros sit in Belgian current accounts, earning close to no interest.

We’re putting an end to that with the official launch of our fully localised offer in Belgium:

-- A free current account with a local IBAN
-- Interest on all your cash
-- Automated tax management with local tax reporting 

It is time to expect more from your bank. Join our over 100.000 Belgium customers.

Access to new features will be rolled out to all customers in the coming days.

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftraderepublic&amp;_l=de&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TradeRepublic</a>

Investing involves risks. Products offered by Trade Republic Bank GmbH, Belgium branch. Trade Republic does not provide tax advice.
Source: Financial accounts of Belgium, National Bank of Belgium, July 2026
</p>
          
            
                  
    

